            "detailed_description": "Brutal trucks on the track!<br />\r\nTake a part in rallycross competitions on ZiL trucks arranged in different regions of the world.<br />\r\nRallyCross is a competition which are organized on the ring tracks located on rugged terrain.<br />\r\nAll trucks are presented in the sports versions prepared for the ordeal on the tracks.<br />\r\nThe game demonstrates the high driving performance and reliability of ZIL trucks.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game has ZIL-164, ZIL-130 and ZIL-433360 in multiple design options and tech specifications.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game was developed by ZIL license back in 2010.<br />\r\nHowever, ONLY NOW have received a next-gen graphics engine to be presented ONLY in Steam version of the game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe development continues!<br />\r\nNow our team is working on improving car physics, adding new game modes, multiplayer and new tracks.<br />\r\nFollow the development of the game and participate in the development.<br />\r\nOur devteam is waiting for your ideas and suggestions for the further development of the project in the Steam community hub.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe will try to create an original project about truck rallycross!<br />\r\nThe development continues!<br />\r\nZIL LIVED, ZIL LIVE, ZIL WILL LIVE !!!",
            "about_the_game": "Brutal trucks on the track!<br />\r\nTake a part in rallycross competitions on ZiL trucks arranged in different regions of the world.<br />\r\nRallyCross is a competition which are organized on the ring tracks located on rugged terrain.<br />\r\nAll trucks are presented in the sports versions prepared for the ordeal on the tracks.<br />\r\nThe game demonstrates the high driving performance and reliability of ZIL trucks.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game has ZIL-164, ZIL-130 and ZIL-433360 in multiple design options and tech specifications.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game was developed by ZIL license back in 2010.<br />\r\nHowever, ONLY NOW have received a next-gen graphics engine to be presented ONLY in Steam version of the game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe development continues!<br />\r\nNow our team is working on improving car physics, adding new game modes, multiplayer and new tracks.<br />\r\nFollow the development of the game and participate in the development.<br />\r\nOur devteam is waiting for your ideas and suggestions for the further development of the project in the Steam community hub.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe will try to create an original project about truck rallycross!<br />\r\nThe development continues!<br />\r\nZIL LIVED, ZIL LIVE, ZIL WILL LIVE !!!",
            "short_description": "Brutal trucks on the track! Take a part in rallycross competitions on ZiL trucks arranged in different regions of the world. The game has ZIL-164, ZIL-130 and ZIL-433360 in multiple design options and tech specifications. The development continues!",
